Package: AffectiveFunctionalAgingGenetics
Type: Project
Title: Affective-Functional Dynamics Across Ageing Cohorts and Genetic Architectures
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Shi Lv [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Shi Lv <hlniren@163.com>
Authors@R: person("Shi", "Lv", email = "hlniren@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducible analysis workflows for harmonised affective and functional
    health measures across five ageing cohorts, dynamic mortality and dementia-related
    outcomes, five-year mortality prediction, genomic structural equation modelling,
    local genetic architecture, molecular follow-up and external endpoint mapping.
